\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Static escrow vs.\ competitive Vickrey auction. Both regimes underwrite the same coverage $B_T = \mu (1+s)$; only the financing mechanism differs. In (a) the principal ties up $B_T$ for the coverage period, paying an opportunity cost $r \cdot B_T$. In (b) insurers compete; the principal pays only the second-lowest bid $q^*$. The competitive regime Pareto-dominates the static one under the welfare assumptions of \S  \ref {sec:youle:welfare} below.}}{28}{figure.caption.50}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:auction-inline}{{3}{28}{Static escrow vs.\ competitive Vickrey auction. Both regimes underwrite the same coverage $B_T = \mu (1+s)$; only the financing mechanism differs. In (a) the principal ties up $B_T$ for the coverage period, paying an opportunity cost $r \cdot B_T$. In (b) insurers compete; the principal pays only the second-lowest bid $q^*$. The competitive regime Pareto-dominates the static one under the welfare assumptions of \S \ref {sec:youle:welfare} below}{figure.caption.50}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Monte Carlo comparison of competitive auction and the specified static-escrow baseline. Left: fraction of trials satisfying the code's Pareto criterion versus reputation noise $\sigma _r$ at $n=5$, split by cartel size. Right: the same criterion versus insurer count at $\sigma _r=0$ with no cartel. Error bars and seeds are recorded in the accompanying artifact; the curves are not analytical welfare bounds.}}{28}{figure.caption.51}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pareto-mc-inline}{{4}{28}{Monte Carlo comparison of competitive auction and the specified static-escrow baseline. Left: fraction of trials satisfying the code's Pareto criterion versus reputation noise $\sigma _r$ at $n=5$, split by cartel size. Right: the same criterion versus insurer count at $\sigma _r=0$ with no cartel. Error bars and seeds are recorded in the accompanying artifact; the curves are not analytical welfare bounds}{figure.caption.51}{}}
